  "slug": "corrective-action-quality-report-form",
  "title": "Corrective Action Quality Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Reconcile the root-cause and recurrence-prevention action population, summarize evidence and trends, separate limitations from conclusions, assign decisions, and track follow-up.",
  "description": "A decision-ready corrective action quality report form that turns source records for a systemic quality issue and affected process scope into reconciled measures, exception patterns, qualified conclusions, owned actions, and a retrievable reporting package.",
  "use_case": "Use when the process owner and effectiveness reviewer needs a bounded quality report for the root-cause and recurrence-prevention action rather than a raw inspection checklist or chronological log.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
