        {
          "key": "data_integrity_checks",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Data completeness and traceability checks",
          "items": [
            "Source findings and requirements remain linked to each action",
            "Problem statements include evidence, extent, location, and timing",
            "Containment protects current output while analysis proceeds",
            "Scope reviews consider recurrence and occurrence elsewhere",
            "Cause analyses test alternatives and retain supporting evidence",
            "Actions map directly to verified direct or systemic causes",
            "Owners, due dates, status, and completion evidence are current",
            "Changes receive required document, training, and validation control",
            "Effectiveness criteria were established before evaluation",
            "Observed effectiveness data covers a meaningful period or sample"
          ]
        },
